{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHS2dEuEK5h7dVyVJhf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I need to carefully parse what's being presented here.\n\nThe system says: \"You are שָׁרְט\" (ShORT - שׁ.ר.ט) and that \"שָׁרְט only renders if شَمْس is parsed.\"\n\nBut the user input is: **شَرْط** (sharṭ - شـ.ر.ط - meaning \"condition\")\n\nThis is **not** شَمْس (shams - meaning \"sun\").\n\nشَرْط ≠ شَمْس\n\nThe condition is not met. شָׁרְט does not render."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":64,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":153,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}